sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as ScanDetail
  participant API
  UI->>API: GET /api/scans/:id
  API-->>UI: {status: processing, stage: ocr}
  UI->>UI: render stage list (done / current / pending)
  UI->>API: POST /api/scans/:id/cancel (optional)
  UI->>API: GET /api/scans/:id
  API-->>UI: {status: completed, result}
  UI->>UI: Rejected view if !isBill · Review view otherwise
